{"id":"1a17938a1fa25964","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-assignment.md","title":"Context assignment","display":"df-assignment — Context assignment","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","label":"16-df-assignment","aliases":["16-df-assignment","Context assignment"],"display":"df-assignment — Context assignment","depends_on":[],"source":"§10.1 pp.585–592 (PDF605–612); explicit set-family telescope instance","revision_date":"2026-10-16"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-assignment"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-assignment</span><span>Context assignment</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-assignment — Context assignment"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source","html":"§10.1 pp.585–592 (PDF605–612); explicit set-family telescope instance"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-16"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>固定Grothendieck宇宙 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\">\\(\\mathcal U\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma=(x_i:A_i)_{i=1}^n\">\\(\\Gamma=(x_i:A_i)_{i=1}^n\\)</span> 是依赖语境；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(F_i)_{i=1}^n\">\\(M=(F_i)_{i=1}^n\\)</span> 是给定集合族解释数据，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_i:\\mathcal U^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\mathcal U\">\\(F_i:\\mathcal U^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\mathcal U\\)</span>，在合法前缀赋值上 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_i(\\gamma)\">\\(F_i(\\gamma)\\)</span> 给第i个声明的类型解释。把它延拓到非法前缀的值不影响下文。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\">\\(A_i\\)</span> 在此是语法标签，不预设它的集合元素。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"()\">\\(()\\)</span> 是空有限序列，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gamma\\mathbin{\\frown}\\langle a\\rangle\">\\(\\gamma\\mathbin{\\frown}\\langle a\\rangle\\)</span> 是有限序列附加。下列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_i\">\\(V_i\\)</span> 按 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\le n\">\\(i\\le n\\)</span> 递归，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Assign}_M(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\mathsf{Assign}_M(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 是最终赋值集。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nV_0&amp;\\coloneqq\\{()\\},\\\\\nV_{i+1}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\gamma\\mathbin{\\frown}\\langle a\\rangle\\mid\\gamma\\in V_i\\land a\\in F_{i+1}(\\gamma)\\}\\quad(i&lt;n),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Assign}_M(\\Gamma)&amp;\\coloneqq V_n.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nV_0&amp;\\coloneqq\\{()\\},\\\\\nV_{i+1}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\gamma\\mathbin{\\frown}\\langle a\\rangle\\mid\\gamma\\in V_i\\land a\\in F_{i+1}(\\gamma)\\}\\quad(i&lt;n),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Assign}_M(\\Gamma)&amp;\\coloneqq V_n.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对语境长度递归，后续类型的取值集合可依赖所有先前分量。这里把集合模型所需的类型族接口明示为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_i\">\\(F_i\\)</span>；完整DTT模型如何产生这些族须另外核对，不能仅凭一个“模型M”名称得到任意解释函数。该构造不要求任何 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_i(\\gamma)\">\\(F_i(\\gamma)\\)</span> 非空，空语境恰有唯一空赋值。来源 §10.1 pp.585–592 (PDF605–612) 的依赖语境；本页只展开其集合族实例。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal U","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma=(x_i:A_i)_{i=1}^n","display":false},{"tex":"M=(F_i)_{i=1}^n","display":false},{"tex":"F_i:\\mathcal U^{<\\omega}\\to\\mathcal U","display":false},{"tex":"F_i(\\gamma)","display":false},{"tex":"A_i","display":false},{"tex":"()","display":false},{"tex":"\\gamma\\mathbin{\\frown}\\langle a\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"V_i","display":false},{"tex":"i\\le n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Assign}_M(\\Gamma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nV_0&\\coloneqq\\{()\\},\\\\\nV_{i+1}&\\coloneqq\\{\\gamma\\mathbin{\\frown}\\langle a\\rangle\\mid\\gamma\\in V_i\\land a\\in F_{i+1}(\\gamma)\\}\\quad(i<n),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Assign}_M(\\Gamma)&\\coloneqq V_n.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"F_i","display":false},{"tex":"F_i(\\gamma)","display":false}],"bytes":1637,"backlinks":[{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-129","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[16-df-assignment|df-assignment — Context assignment]]"}],"outgoing":[]}